<topic xml:id="sle15-packages-lifecycle-db"
 role="concept" xml:lang="en"
 xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook" version="5.2"
 xmlns:its="http://www.w3.org/2005/11/its"
 xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"
 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
 xmlns:trans="http://docbook.org/ns/transclusion">
  <info>
    <title>Database lifecycle support</title>
    <meta name="maintainer" content="lkucharczyk@suse.com" its:translate="no"/>
  </info>
  <variablelist>
    <varlistentry>
      <term>MariaDB</term>
      <listitem>
        <para>MariaDB is upgraded to the latest stable LTS release with each Service Pack (10.6 in SP4/SP5, 10.11 in SP6, 11.8 LTS in SP7). Older Service Packs receive security backports. MariaDB 11.8 LTS is supported until SP7 LTSS ends (December 2034).</para>
      </listitem>
    </varlistentry>
    <varlistentry>
      <term>PostgreSQL</term>
      <listitem>
        <table xml:id="table-sle15-postgresql-lifecycle" frame="all">
          <title>PostgreSQL version support on &suselinux; 15</title>
          <tgroup cols="5">
            <colspec colname="c1" colwidth="1.5*"/>
            <colspec colname="c2" colwidth="1*"/>
            <colspec colname="c3" colwidth="1*"/>
            <colspec colname="c4" colwidth="1.2*"/>
            <colspec colname="c5" colwidth="1.2*"/>
            <thead>
              <row>
                <entry>Service Pack</entry>
                <entry>PostgreSQL 14</entry>
                <entry>PostgreSQL 15</entry>
                <entry>PostgreSQL 16</entry>
                <entry>PostgreSQL 17</entry>
              </row>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <row>
                <entry>&suselinux; 15 SP4</entry>
                <entry>Default</entry>
                <entry>—</entry>
                <entry>—</entry>
                <entry>—</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry>&suselinux; 15 SP5</entry>
                <entry>Legacy Module</entry>
                <entry>Default</entry>
                <entry>Maintenance update</entry>
                <entry>Maintenance update</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry>&suselinux; 15 SP6</entry>
                <entry>—</entry>
                <entry>Legacy Module</entry>
                <entry>Default</entry>
                <entry>Maintenance update</entry>
              </row>
              <row>
                <entry>&suselinux; 15 SP7</entry>
                <entry>—</entry>
                <entry>Legacy Module</entry>
                <entry>Legacy Module</entry>
                <entry>Default</entry>
              </row>
            </tbody>
          </tgroup>
        </table>
      </listitem>
    </varlistentry>
    <varlistentry>
      <term>Redis and Valkey</term>
      <listitem>
        <para>Redis was shipped up to &suselinux; 15 SP6 (Redis 6.2 in SP4/SP5, 7.2 in SP6). Redis is removed starting in SP7 and replaced with Valkey 8.0.x (which is downward-compatible). Valkey minor versions can be updated in &suselinux; 15 SP7.</para>
      </listitem>
    </varlistentry>
  </variablelist>
</topic>
